/-! ## Maximal domination of the active coordinate convolution

Source: `lem:fiber_kernel`, blueprint lines 2232--2257, third display
`|f *_j (κ_j)_{s,su_j}(x)| ≤ C U(u)^{10} M^{(j)} f(x)`.
