        (∫ w in D, ‖g w‖ *
          (∑ I ∈ T, ∫ t : ℝ in Set.Ioi 0,
            |∫ y : ℝ, fiberCZBadAtom F
              (fiberDyadicSelectionSet Zf Astop H) I (y, z) *
              kernelDilate (activeModelKernel i j u) (t ^ α)
                (realToFiberDyadicLine.symm w - y)| * t⁻¹)) ≤
          (C * sourceWeight u ^ 10 * (4 * B) * (α⁻¹ * (1 / 72))) *
