        (4 * 2 ^ (1 / p) *
          C_lpNorm_finset_double_intervalTails_le_of_radius_sum qc) *
        (Cw * aux_lineMaximalConst P₁) * (Cw * aux_lineMaximalConst P₂)) + 1

/-- **The one-fiber weak bound at the manuscript's own constant.** -/
