-/

/-- **`thm:extended_model` for the truncated form.**

`|∫ f₀ · U^{a,b}_{u,c}(f₁,f₂,f₃)| ≤ C·U(u)^{100}·∏_{j=0}^3‖f_j‖_{p_j}`, for
bounded measurable active slots of finite `L^{p_j}` norm, uniformly in the
